{"text": "Northern Lights Immigration Consulting Inc.\nCONSULTATION NOTES (paid initial, 60 min)                 File: NL-26-1187\n\nConsultant: Harpreet Dhillon-Marchetti, RCIC R712904\nDate: 2026-10-07     In person, Saskatoon office\n\nCLIENT\nName:      ADEBAYO-CLARKE, Oluwaseun  (goes by \"Seun\")\nDOB:       1994-06-02\nStatus:    Nigerian citizen; post-graduation work permit, expires 2027-01-18\nPassport:  A09471126 (exp. 14 FEB 2029)\nUCI:       11-0447-2913\nSIN:       326 357 266\nAddress:   Unit 12 - 815 Kristjanson Road, Saskatoon SK  S7S 1M9\nPhone:     306.555.0156      Email: seun.adebayoclarke@mailbox.example\nSpouse:    Chidinma Adebayo-Clarke, open work permit, expecting their first child in February\n\nWORK / EDUCATION\nM.Sc. Computer Science, University of Regina, conferred June 2024. Since August 12, 2024\nfull-time software developer (NOC 21232) at Prairie Sky Agri-Tech Ltd., salary $84,000.\nSupervisor Lorne Pasternak will sign the reference letter. Prairie Sky has about 30 staff\nand has never supported a PR application before.\n\nISSUES RAISED\n1. Express Entry profile: he self-calculated CRS 471. I get the same with CLB 9 across the\n   board. Recent CEC draws have been higher, so we also look at SINP.\n2. Prior refusal. Seun was refused a US visitor visa in 2019 and did not list it on his\n   study permit application. I explained IRPA s. 40 (misrepresentation) plainly. We disclose\n   now, with an explanation letter, on IMM 5669 and everywhere else.\n3. He asked whether it matters that his brother claimed asylum in the UK. Told him it\n   is not his claim, but he must answer family questions truthfully.\n4. Chidinma's permit is tied to his; both expire the same day.\n\nFEES\nConsult fee $250.00 + GST paid by Visa 4379 7518 8853 5872, exp 09/28, CVV 614 (taken by\nphone at booking -- front desk please do NOT leave this on the file copy).\nQuoted flat fee for full PR application: C$4,800 in three instalments.\n\nNEXT\n- Mr. Adebayo-Clarke to send pay stubs, T4, passport scans (all pages)\n- I draft the explanation letter by the 21st\n- Retainer agreement out by e-sign\n\nH. Dhillon-Marchetti", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "319 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Harpreet Dhillon-Marchetti", "Oluwaseun Adebayo-Clarke", "Chidinma Adebayo-Clarke", "Lorne Pasternak"], "companies": ["Northern Lights Immigration Consulting Inc.", "Prairie Sky Agri-Tech Ltd.", "Visa 4379 7518 8853 5872"]}, "topics": {"places": ["Saskatoon", "University of Regina"], "health": [], "sensitive": ["Nigerian citizen", "post-graduation work permit", "US visitor visa", "asylum"], "names": ["Harpreet", "Oluwaseun", "Seun", "Chidinma"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "topicErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.10000000149011612, "modelMs": 0, "topicMs": 20281.79999999702, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "card_partial", "phone", "dob", "age90", "date", "passport_dl", "routing", "credential", "device", "vin", "record", "account", "money", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "places", "names", "sensitive_topics"], "detections": [{"start": 0, "end": 43, "text": "Northern Lights Immigration Consulting Inc.", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Northern Lights Immigration Consulting Inc."}, {"start": 108, "end": 118, "text": "NL-26-1187", "kind": "record", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "NL-26-1187"}, {"start": 132, "end": 158, "text": "Harpreet Dhillon-Marchetti", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Harpreet Dhillon-Marchetti"}, {"start": 179, "end": 189, "text": "2026-10-07", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "2026-10-07"}, {"start": 205, "end": 214, "text": "Saskatoon", "kind": "places", "source": "model", "canonical": "Saskatoon"}, {"start": 241, "end": 266, "text": "ADEBAYO-CLARKE, Oluwaseun", "kind": "person", "source": "short-form", "canonical": "Oluwaseun Adebayo-Clarke"}, {"start": 278, "end": 282, "text": "Seun", "kind"